  IDrive | https://www.idrive.com | https://www.idrive.com/pricing |
  Jottacloud | https://www.jottacloud.com/en/ | https://www.jottacloud.com/en/pricing/ |
  Zoolz | https://www.zoolz.com | https://www.zoolz.com/pricing/ |
  Storj | https://storj.io | https://storj.io/pricing |
